ubcc0\ud658]256PUTTZZLE_RAW_IMAGE_8.png", "id": "1174988316468342", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982474_1174988319801675_5356656402935387114_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rLWAy3BK6gkQ7kNvwEONQ29&_nc_oc=AdrGc8gKbp8KWxK8L7K4M99Qvzm_4VYvuz8BqE27mm8MTKP6eDSoguelqSqzh64yFjQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGUU7RY-_iZ1dYfIXBlLt2RTZcIy6xhIgFbt0i4gQufRg&oe=6A7494DC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\ucea1\ucc98_2022_10_28_17_08_12_390.png", "id": "665571025131462", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75222944_665571028464795_3967012109877024291_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=92sSe_Br5McQ7kNvwFLEAqH&_nc_oc=Adp1-EB-0OJP4keUagSkzeNAV4NXYMoQxKEB5uBqirWuw7Qi1BjMRK8lXDGI7BY08wo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGl65-DBJ-O-mIQ0sPKyLqPgghELxATRYqLOOc3fvRBFg&oe=6A74726A"}, "display_name": "PUTTZZLE", "keywords": [], "long_description": "You have only one objective in this game:  Putt your ball into the hole. \nIn order to do so, you will be given two items in this game: a hammer and a heavy ball.\n\nJust putt the ball into the hole to complete each stage. \n-Try to avoid various terrain and obstacles.\n-Try using any method to complete the stage with the number of given opportunities.\n \n[Intuitive controls]\nPUTTZZLE is simple. Just putt the ball into the hole by any means. \n\n[Entertainment from simplicity]\nJust focus on putting the ball into the target.\nCalculate the number of cases to solve each stage. \n\n[Increasing difficulty level]\n[PUTTZLE] is like a puzzle. You will experience more complicated stages as you finish each stage with even more obstacles. \nYou can even utilize obstacles or avoid them to finish the stage.", "short_description": "PUTT YOUR BALL IN IT! "}]}, "developer_name": "Pixelity Gamelab", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pixelitygames.com/privacy-poli